{"id":"vod_lz_11752","vodId":"11752","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"某科学的超电磁炮S","name_cn":"某科学的超电磁炮S","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20220428-1/ca827adb85077370d31388c9cd0f12dd.jpg"},"summary":"　　面积占东京都西部1/3、人口超过230万、八成以上由学生组成的学园都市，尖端科技发展迅速，超能力开发已经深入到城市的各个角落。超能力水平高达Level 5的御坂美琴（佐藤利奈 配音）如往常一样和初春饰利（丰崎爱生 配音）、白井黑子（新井里美 配音）等好友过着平凡的日子，间或热血爆发挫败各种扰乱城市的阴谋。某天，在调查一起现今卡事件时她邂逅了长点上机学园的布束砥信（叶山郁美 配音），从而得知用美琴的DNA大批量复制超能力者的“量产型能力者计划”。不安定的气氛在都市角落肆意蔓延……                                     　　本片为镰池和马（原作）、冬川基（作画）的原作《魔法禁书目录》的外传漫画第二季TV动画。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2022-04-28 16:39:55","classic":true,"classicRank":6,"franchise":"某科学的超电磁炮","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220428/12931_1487dffc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220428/12934_a2466058/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220428/12935_7f9ddf10/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220428/12939_603252e7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220428/12937_7807c38c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220428/12936_bc557aa3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220428/12938_861a508e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220428/12940_1e6b14c0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220428/12944_04223b32/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220428/12942_258e68d6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220428/12941_d3aaa17e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220428/12943_6f0c2d47/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220428/12945_be1b5b35/index.m3u8"},{"name":"